   Directory    ~/code/app                                                                          
   Rex session   work  [side projects]  new session                                                 
   Model         default   fable  [opus]  sonnet   haiku                                            
   Effort        default   low   medium   high  [xhigh]  max                                        
 ▶ Permissions   default  [acceptEdits]  auto   plan   bypassPermissions                            
   Worktree      no  [yes]                                                                          
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
